WEBVTT

00:02.160 --> 00:05.080
Tonight we'll hold a banquet to entertain the envoy.

00:06.840 --> 00:10.520
First take the envoy to rest thank you, Your Highness.

00:17.440 --> 00:21.080
Brother-in-law the northern expedition affects everything with one move.

00:21.760 --> 00:25.920
General Zu entrusted us with the strategic Yiyang even if the seal is real.

00:26.000 --> 00:28.280
Does brother-in-law really plan to turn south?

00:28.360 --> 00:34.080
Though it goes against righteousness the matter of going north can wait for another opportunity one city.

00:34.160 --> 00:40.160
One place temporary gains and losses indeed cannot compare to the long term.

00:40.360 --> 00:43.627
Your subject asks Your Highness to reconsider.

